{
  "_README": "Metadata for the 2025-2026 Lake Taney thermistor campaign — option3 (pressure-derived dynamic depths). Two sub-products are built from this single .meta: option3A (dynamic depth axis: each thermistor has a time-varying depth corrected by delta_wl) and option3B (fixed depth axis: thermistor nominal depths used as interpolation nodes for cross-chain comparison). Both sub-products are restricted to the pressure-sensor window: 2025-06-06 -> 2026-01-18. Chains A and B are kept separate as in option2. NEVER hardcode a depth in any script. Depths for Buoy B thermistors are computed in-code as total_depth - raw_depth_value.",
